---
layout: base.njk
title: Past events
permalink: /past/
description: Recent editions of conferences in the Human Science Network directory.
---
{% from "card.njk" import card %}
<section class="wrap page">
  <h1>Past events</h1>
  <p class="lede">The most recent editions of meetings in our directory. Events move here automatically once their end date has passed. When the next edition is confirmed, it appears under <a href="/">upcoming conferences</a>.</p>
  <form class="filters filters-slim" role="search" aria-label="Search past events" onsubmit="return false">
    <div class="f-search"><label for="q">Search</label><input id="q" type="search" placeholder="Conference, society, city…"></div>
  </form>
  <p class="count" id="count" aria-live="polite">{{ catalog.past.length }} events</p>
  <ol class="cards cards-compact" id="upcoming-list">
    {% for l in catalog.past %}{{ card(l, catalog.today) }}{% endfor %}
  </ol>
  <p class="empty" id="empty" hidden>No past events match.</p>
</section>
<script src="/assets/filter.js?v=12" defer></script>
